        "observation": "Viewed both widths for expanded details1/2. Summary labels, manual-EOS example, distinction between text_foundation and bigram/MLP, and fixed-SFT versus local attributes checkpoint are readable in the blue panels. Narrow code blocks scroll locally. Panels and following T.4/T.5 headings preserve a clear boundary; mobile summary wraps normally without clipping."
      },
      {
