        "observation": "Viewed expanded details3/4 at both widths before this record. Fixed style/safety dependency text, separate local-practice caveat, licensing text and LoRA base/merged distinction are legible. Resume and fixed-vqa partial-versus-CLI distinction, own-file16×16/16kHz inputs and OCR ablation description remain within the panel. Mobile detail4 continues below this viewport normally; source entirety was read separately, no claim every lower pixel appears in this one shot."
      },
      {
        "recorded_after_personal_view_at": "2026-10-16T21:03:43.349177+00:00",
        "screenshot_ids": [
