        "observation": "Viewed expanded details5/6 at both widths. DPO fixed style dependency versus200-step local checkpoint and PPO prewritten-card limitation remain visible. Fixed-modern/MoE recipe, T.10 teacher output paths, separate efficiency commands and measurement-condition subsection render in order inside one panel. Mobile long efficiency panel naturally continues below the crop; no collapsed clipping or header/body overlap is present in inspected portions."
